OL,3,A'I want to destroy capitalism, not
OL,4,AFrance': On the streets with the French
OL,5,Aultra left
OL,6,
OL,7,FFrance is in turmoil. Crippling public
OL,8,Fdebt, a "lame-duck" president with six
OL,9,Fmonths left in office, and massive
OL,10,Fsocial unrest - sparked by student
OL,11,Fprotests which have erupted into
OL,12,Flooting and violence.
OL,14,FThis Saturday marked the sixth weekend
OL,15,Fin a row of demos against soaring
OL,16,Fprices, worsening public services and
OL,17,Falleged police brutality. Violence by
OL,18,Fprotesters is down on last month but
OL,19,Fstill present.
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
